# Defining this file replaces the defaults bundled with @wordpress/scripts,
# so their entries are repeated here.
build
vendor

# Vendored Go WebAssembly runtime, shipped verbatim from the Go toolchain via
# gll-tools. Reformatting it would rewrite ~700 lines of upstream code and make
# every future refresh a conflict.
assets/wasm/wasm_exec.js

# Golden fixtures for the two display-subset implementations. `make-goldens.mjs`
# writes these, and both the Jest and PHPUnit suites parse rather than diff them,
# so their formatting is the generator's business. Letting Prettier own it would
# mean every regeneration also had to be re-formatted, and a mismatch would look
# like a shape change in review when it is only whitespace.
tests/fixtures/*.json
